; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on XAUUSD - best trailing of M2: Step trailing (TrailMode 4), setup 1 of 2: sell, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter M30 EMA 100, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON BTC.
; Trailing: every 1.5R of profit lifts the stop by 1.5R, one step behind (breakeven at +1.5R). Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 4, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (FTMO spread, no commission; score 1.43): 91 trades, PF 1.81. Replay of the same months: 83 trades, PF 1.47.
; TICK REPLAY (every Dukascopy tick, the EA's rules; VT costs: VT's 0.15 spread scaled by Dukascopy's own spread, 0.60 USD commission per ounce). May 16 - Nov 13 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 51 trades, PF 1.30, net +9.2R (stressed PF 1.15); the 2 setups of M2 + Step together 105 trades, PF 1.06, net +4.1R (stressed 0.98).
; Step was chosen as the best of the EA's trailing systems on M2 (highest PF of those with 100+ trades in those months), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: Jul 15 - Dec 31 2024, 37 trades, PF 0.64. The 2 setups together: Jul 15 - Dec 31 2024, 70 trades, PF 0.76. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Dukascopy XAUUSD ticks, broker server time. Commission is in the figures: set CommissionPerLot to your round-trip commission per lot.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
